This gate qualifies one exact optional accelerator tuple after CPU semantics exist. It does not make an accelerator a release requirement or correctness dependency. The backend is first-party Rust, request/region owned, capability-free except bounded tensor jobs, and cannot access secrets, the canonical ledger, network, or effects.

